  "description": "\"'??'s favorability rating has increased.\"\n\nThe game I was trying to play wouldn't work, so I slammed my laptop in frustration, driven by drunken rage and a sense of hopelessness. Surprisingly, I found myself in a dating simulation game!\n\nBut why does my favorability rating keep increasing, even when I make bad choices?\n\nThis game is fucking ruined.\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/211030490), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/sybk1608), [Bookcube](https://www.bookcube.com/detail.asp?series_num=919021584)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/BclassLoveGame), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/b_love_simulation_game)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nEnglish (Jul 22)",
